tras/51f9f77671b2a4832eb01758772e18b1.webm?t=1757675746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle a diverse roster of enemies, from basic immune cells like macrophages and T-cells to rival parasites such as tapeworms or protozoa. Formidable bosses are lurking deep within the host's organs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE A MICROSCOPIC WORLD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808690/extras/7657619130db87d0e5fc5290828d216f.poster.avif?t=1757675746\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808690/extras/7657619130db87d0e5fc5290828d216f.webm?t=1757675746\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate the human body, a procedurally generated world of organic wonder. Travel through distinct biomes like the branching pathways of the lungs, the pulsating chambers of the heart, and the complex neural network of the brain.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FEEL THE ORGANIC ACTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our detailed, colorful world is powered by a soft-body physics simulation, giving every cell, enemy, and projectile a uniquely satisfying organic feel.\u00a0The combination of hand-crafted design and procedural generation ensures that no two runs are ever the same, offering endless, challenging gameplay that always stays fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>JOIN OUR COMMUNITY ON DISCORD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3808690/extras/93e6374783ce53cb53551368e91691c3.avif?t=1757675746\" width=1560 height=4