ike twin-stick shooter - a lone parasite, fighting a biological war. Collect organelles to evolve your cell in a microscopic arms race against your host's immune system. Conquer a beautiful, procedurally generated world of tiny proportions.","steam_appid":3808690,"support_info":{"email":"matej.hl@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}